rwalk.webp" alt="ตลาดริมน้ำตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">14</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Markets & Food</span><h3><a href="/en/places/riverwalk/">Takuapa Riverwalk</a></h3><p>Food and life by the river</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="market" data-name="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/culture-street/"><img src="/assets/culture-street.webp" alt="ถนนสายวัฒนธรรมเมืองเก่าตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">15</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Markets & Food</span><h3><a href="/en/places/culture-street/">Takua Pa Old Town Cultural Street</a></h3><p>Walking and reading the city through buildings and people</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="market" data-name="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/food-center/"><img src="/assets/food-center.webp" alt="ศูนย์อาหารลานโล่งตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">20</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Markets & Food</span><h3><a href="/en/places/food-center/">Takua Pa Open-Air Food Center</a></h3><p>Many flavors in one destination</p></div></article><article class="place-card" data-place-card data-category="museum" data-name="พิพิธภัณฑ์เสนานุชรังสรรค์ชุมชนตะกั่วป่า"><a class="place-image" href="/en/places/museum/"><img src="/assets/museum.webp" alt="พิพิธภัณฑ์เสนานุชรังสรรค์ชุมชนตะกั่วป่า" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"><span class="card-index">07</span><span class="image-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Museums</span><h3><a href="/en/places/museum/">Takua Pa Commun