%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%81%20%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A1%20%40%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%28%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%88%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B8%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%29%20%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%20%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find on Google Maps ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://www.phangngapao.go.th/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="eco-print-by-kanokwan" data-shop="Eco Print by Kanokwan กลุ่มผู้ผลิตงานผ้าพิมพ์ลายใบไม้และบาติกที่นำเสนอผลิตภัณฑ์เป็นมิตรกับสิ่งแวดล้อม" class="shop-extra"><span class="shop-number">·</span><span>Eco Print by Kanokwan<small class="shop-note">A group of leaf print and batik fabric makers offering environmentally friendly products.</small><small class="shop-meta">Mo-Su 07:00-23:00</small><a class="shop-nav" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=8.7033812,98.2530902" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Navigate ↗</a><span class="shop-src"><a href="https://emskynet.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">From search</a></span></span></li><li id="souvenir_shop-01" data-shop="เต้าส้อตวงรัตน์"><span class="shop-number">01</span><span>Tuangrat Tao Sor</span></li><li id="souvenir_shop-02" data-shop="เต้าส้อนันทวัน"><span class="shop-number">02</span><span>Nanthawan Tao Sor</span></li><li id="souvenir_shop-03" data-shop="เต้าส้อแม่อารี"><span class="shop-number">03</span><span>Mae Ari Tao Sor</span></li><li id="souvenir_shop-04" data-shop="ขนมผิงลูกแม่แบบ"><span class="shop-number">04</span><span>Luk Mae Baep Khanom Ping</span></li><li id="souvenir_shop-05" data-shop="เต้าส้อเจ๊หยี่"><span class="shop-number">05</span><span>Je Yi Tao Sor</span></li><li id="souvenir_shop-06" data-shop="เต้าส้อป้าแอ๋ว"><span class="shop-number">06</span><span>Pa Aew Tao Sor</span></li><li id="souvenir_shop-07" data-shop="สิริพร"><span class="shop-number">07</span><span>Siriporn</span></li><li id="souvenir_shop-08" data-shop="วุ้นกะทิมะพร้าวอ่อน เอสโซ่-ตะกั่วป่า"><span class="shop-number">08</span><span>Young Coconut Milk Jelly, Esso Takua Pa</span></li></ol></section><aside class="source"><h2>Data Sources</h2><p>Compiled from<a href="https://www.takuapacity.go.th/pdf/travel-preview.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Takua Pa Town Municipality brochure</a> · Data extracted September 6, 2026 (2569 BE). The document does not specify a publication date. Opening hours, shop status, and current schedules are not verified. Please check with the venue before traveling.</p></aside></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-top"><a href="/en/" class="footer-name">Takua Pa <em>101</em></a><p>One city<br>Stories to get to know</p><a class="round-link" href="#main" aria-label="กลับขึ้นด้านบน">↑</a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><a href="https://siwaracafe.com/">Created by Baan Siwara, Takua Pa</a><span>Old Town Guide · Phang Nga Province</span><a href="https://www.takuapacity.go.th/pdf/travel-preview.pdf">Original Brochure ↗</a></div></footer><nav class="tabbar" aria-label="เมนูด่วน"><a href="/en/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>Home</a><a href="/en/map/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>Map</a><a href="/en/eat/" aria-current="page"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◉</span>Eat</a><a href="/en/trip/"><span class="tb-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◫</span>Trip<span class="qs-badge" data-trip-count hidden>0</span></a></nav></body></html>
